  "zh": "# 今日热点聚焦AI模型发布与深度伪造、机器人出口激增及国际局势\n## AI 与科技\n- **DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 模型**：该模型在推理速度与资源消耗上实现突破，或将加速边缘设备上的AI应用。\n- **演员吴越 AI 假冒带货**：明星形象被AI深度伪造用于带货，凸显内容安全与版权风险亟待监管。\n- **人形机器人产业前景**：产业链加速成熟，资本与技术双向驱动，预示服务机器人将迎爆发式增长。\n## 产业动向\n- **机器人出口暴增1220%**：出口数据激增反映全球制造业对自动化需求急升，中国机器人企业获重要市场机遇。\n- **特斯拉飞行汽车质疑**：尽管概念吸睛，但技术可行性与监管尚存疑问，需警惕过度炒作带来的投资风险。\n- **英伟达 RTX5090 未停产**：英伟达明确高端显卡继续供应，缓解了游戏与AI计算领域的硬件短期紧张。\n## 国际视野\n- **普京称消灭2000名乌军**：俄方宣称在战场上取得重大战果，真实性有待验证，但对冲突走向具重要信号价值。\n- **太阳能首次超过核能**：太阳能发电量首次超越核能，标志全球能源结构向可再生能源加速转型。",
  "en": "# Today's highlights center on AI model launches, deepfake controversies, surging robot exports, and key international developments.\n## AI & Tech\n- **DeepSeek V4.1 Flash model release**：Its inference speed and low resource consumption mark a breakthrough, poised to accelerate AI deployment on edge devices.\n- **Actor Wu Yue deepfake endorsement scandal**：The misuse of AI to fake a celebrity promoting products highlights urgent needs for content security and copyright regulation.\n- **Humanoid robot industry outlook**：Maturing supply chains and dual capital-tech drivers signal imminent explosive growth in service robots.\n## Industry Trends\n- **Robot exports surge 1220%**：The spike reflects soaring global demand for automation, presenting major market opportunities for Chinese robot makers.\n- **Tesla flying car faces skepticism**：While the concept grabs headlines, technical feasibility and regulatory hurdles remain uncertain, warning against hype‑driven investment.\n- **NVIDIA confirms RTX 5090 still in production**：NVIDIA's assurance eases short-term supply concerns for gamers and AI workloads relying on high-end GPUs.\n## International\n- **Russia claims killing 2,000 Ukrainian troops**: Moscow's battlefield claim, though unverified, carries significant signaling weight for the conflict’s trajectory.\n- **Solar power surpasses nuclear globally**: Solar electricity output exceeding nuclear for the first time marks a decisive shift toward renewable‑dominant energy systems."
